I'm sorry...

00:22:03.590 --> 00:22:06.030
It's okay.
I'm sorry...

00:22:08.000 --> 00:22:09.960
I know!

00:22:19.510 --> 00:22:21.080
Let's light off these guys!

00:22:21.080 --> 00:22:22.040
Huh?
Let's light off these guys!

00:22:22.510 --> 00:22:24.250
Okay?

00:22:24.250 --> 00:22:26.110
Sure.
Okay?

00:22:28.680 --> 00:22:30.650
Hold on a sec, okay?!

00:22:51.970 --> 00:22:53.600
Ayuka...

00:23:03.050 --> 00:23:05.250
Stop looking at me like that...

00:23:06.550 --> 00:23:08.520
S...Sure...

00:23:31.210 --> 00:23:37.170
And, so... that's how
our summer break... began...

00:23:54.970 --> 00:24:02.580
I dream of casting a spell that captures your heart...

00:24:02.580 --> 00:24:10.160
...and makes you crazy about me.

00:24:10.160 --> 00:24:25.510
Love is deja vu; an unfamiliar memory. I feel our lips pressing together.

00:24:25.510 --> 00:24:38.120
Love me... tenderly...
Golden Summer Mirage...

00:24:38.120 --> 00:24:48.330
Someday... Someday...
Please let my body feel your lips...

00:24:48.330 --> 00:24:55.340
...on that morning I'll be called your lover.

00:24:55.340 --> 00:25:06.740
Someday, someday...
I'll be waiting for that moment.

00:25:12.580 --> 00:25:16.590
Summer Vacation!
Right now we're on an island.

00:25:16.590 --> 00:25:18.190
The expansive blue skies...

00:25:18.190 --> 00:25:20.430
The horizon that seems to
extend to infinity...

00:25:20.430 --> 00:25:23.400
And, the sea... it begins to come alive...

00:25:23.400 --> 00:25:26.270
Is this what people call the "Big Monday?"

00:25:26.270 --> 00:25:30.700
Next time: "Madoka's Challenge!
The Haunted Beach's Big Wave Legend."
